SUMMARY:Sunprint to Story: Cyanotype as Collage
DESCRIPTION:Join local mixed media artist Sue Bradshaw for a hands-on works
 hop making cyanotype sunprints and collage. You’ll unite light\, objects
  and paper to create a visual story. Open to all skill levels\, this works
 hop invites you to bring small objects and images to weave into your story
 . If you are not sure where to begin\, Sue will offer inspiration\, guidan
 ce\, and a range of examples to spark ideas. By day’s end\, each student
  will leave with a finished sunprint story of their own.
LOCATION:Cooroy Butter Factory Arts Centre
URL:https://events.humanitix.com/sunprint-to-sunstory
END:VEVENT
