DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260926T180000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260926T200000
SUMMARY:EMOWAVE at The Presynct
DESCRIPTION:EMOWAVE AT THE PRESYNCT The eyeliner is back. The anthems never
  left. Get ready for a full night of emo and pop punk nostalgia as EMOWAVE
  at The Presynct takes over Nambour for one massive celebration of the son
 gs that defined a generation. Headlining the night are Forever On High\, o
 ne of the Gold Coast's rising alternative acts\, bringing their explosive 
 live show and soaring anthems to The Presynct. They'll be joined by Dirty 
 Hearts and No Clue\, before we hand things over to the DJ to keep the ener
 gy going until midnight. Expect wall-to-wall emo\, pop punk and alternativ
 e classics from artists including: My Chemical Romance • Paramore • Fa
 ll Out Boy • Bring Me The Horizon • A Day To Remember • Blink-182 
 • Linkin Park • Sleeping With Sirens • Sum 41 • All Time Low • G
 reen Day • Panic! At The Disco • Good Charlotte • Bullet For My Vale
 ntine • Escape The Fate • The Amity Affliction • Falling In Reverse 
 • Bad Omens and many more. Whether you grew up blasting these bands on y
 our iPod or you've only just discovered them\, this is your chance to sing
  every word\, relive the glory days\, and lose yourself in a night of unfo
 rgettable music. Live Music Forever On High Dirty Hearts No Clue After the
  Bands Our DJ will keep the party alive with the biggest emo and pop punk 
 anthems right through until midnight. Dust off the band tees\, lace up the
  Converse\, gather your crew and prepare for a night of heartbreak\, nosta
 lgia and loud singalongs. This is The Presynct Goes Emo. Emo never died - 
 it just found a new home. 📅 Saturday 26th September ⏰ Doors 6:00pm (H
 appy Hour) | Event Doors from 7:00pm 🎟 General $15+BF | Door $20 🔞 1
 8+ Event 🩴 NO Thongs Permitted 🚱 NO Outside Drink bottles
LOCATION:The Presynct Venue & Bar\, Nambour
URL:https://tickets.oztix.com.au/outlet/event/8b8b7cbe-e723-4a52-b605-5f720
 487b3e9
END:VEVENT
